---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { practice } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Website Terms of Use | Signal & Structure Coaching"
  description="Read the terms for using the Signal & Structure Coaching informational website."
  heading="Website Terms of Use"
  intro="These terms describe the intended use and limitations of the Signal & Structure Coaching website."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Informational purpose</h2>

    <p>
      This website provides general information about {practice.name} and the
      coaching services presented here. Website content is informational and
      educational and is not individualized medical, mental-health, legal,
      financial, or other professional advice.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Coaching is not therapy</h2>

    <p>
      The services described on this website are presented as coaching focused
      on goals, planning, organization, attention, routines, skills, and
      follow-through. Coaching is not psychotherapy, mental-health treatment,
      medical care, or diagnosis.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>No coaching relationship from website use</h2>

    <p>
      Visiting this website, reading its content, sending a message, or
      requesting a discovery call does not by itself create a coach-client
      relationship. Any coaching relationship would begin only after the coach
      and client separately agree to the applicable services, expectations,
      and terms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Emergencies and urgent needs</h2>

    <p>
      This website and the coaching services described here are not emergency
      or crisis resources. Do not use ordinary website communication or a
      discovery-call request for an emergency. If you or someone else may be
      in immediate danger, contact the appropriate local emergency or crisis
      resource.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>External links and services</h2>

    <p>
      This website may link to third-party websites or services for
      convenience. {practice.name} does not control unrelated external
      services and is not responsible for their availability, content, terms,
      or privacy practices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Website content</h2>

    <p>
      Unless otherwise noted, the text, branding, graphics, layouts, and other
      original website materials are provided for viewing and personal,
      noncommercial use. They may not be copied, republished, or represented
      as another person’s or organization’s work without permission.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Availability and accuracy</h2>

    <p>
      Reasonable care may be taken to keep website information useful and
      current, but {practice.name} does not guarantee that every page will
      always be available, complete, current, or free from errors. Information
      about a coaching service does not guarantee that the service is
      appropriate or available for every visitor.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>

    <p>
      These terms may be revised as the website, services, or business
      practices change. Continued use of the website is subject to the version
      published here.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Demonstration notice</h2>

    <p>
      Signal & Structure Coaching and Avery Reed are fictional. This website
      was created as a Brighter Sites portfolio demonstration and does not
      represent an operating coaching business or an offer of actual coaching
      services.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
